<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese unemployment rose to 7.2 pct in Q4.</title>
<headline>Portuguese unemployment rose to 7.2 pct in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Portugal rose to 7.2 percent in the fourth quarter, compared with 7.1 in the third quarter, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>Portuguese average unemployment rose to 7.3 percent in 1996 from 7.2 percent in 1995, it added.</p>
<p>					Q4 1996   Q3 1996   Q4 1995</p>
<p> Registered unemployed	  330,200   324,600    334,400</p>
<p> Percentage unemployed	  7.2	   7.1	 7.3</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
